    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bannon Auctioneers are delighted to offer this land extending to c. 15 acres of excellent quality, laid out in two rectangular shaped division. Full planning was granted for a detached residence and stables. The field of free draining soil is entirely enclosed by trees and hedges providing a private oasis.  In addition to its agricultural capacity, this is an ideal property for a family interested in horses with potential for a one-off house subject to planning permission.  There is valuable road frontage along the boundary, with gateway access here also.  This is one of the best small holdings to come to the market in recent months.\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\nTimes: At any reasonable hour\r\nContact John Bannon 086 8320042"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "15 acres of land with railing and hedges marking boundary.\r\nPrevious planning granted for Residence and stables\r\n15 acres of land in one division.\r\nLarge amount of road frontage.\t\r\nVery private.\r\nRare chance to acquire a small holding.\r\nExcellent potential for further development.\t\r\nExcellent quality.\r\nExcellent location.\r\nWell, maintained.\r\nLarge gate entrance with hard core area.\t\r\nThe land is presented in pristine order throughout \r\nTenure\r\nFreehold"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Directions\r\nFor location purposes only next doors Eircode is A85 P985\r\nFrom Dunshaughlin keep left at O'Brien's Arch Bar, continue to Trim Road after passing through 3 round about at the fourth round about take the first exit and travel for 1 m take the first turn right at roses garden center continue for 1.5 miles and take the left turn at Y and proceeded up that road for 1 miles, at the sharp left bend proceed straight for 1 km and the property is on the right hand side."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing Details\r\nViewing highly recommended times at any reasonable hour\r\nContact John 086 8320042\r\nIf thinking of selling please call for a free valuation John Bannon 086 8320042\r\nLicence No 001005-004176"
      }
    ],
